    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A space mystery in 1-bit pixel art, where every choice unveils dark secrets.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459390/extras/d003fbaed7075ec5b1dd53097df1df58.avif?t=1755639786\" width=800 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In **Switched Destiny**, you play as an astronaut trapped aboard a spaceship invaded by an unknown threat. Guided by an enigmatic AI with motives as cryptic as the cosmos itself, explore claustrophobic corridors, solve clever puzzles, and collect essential items to unlock doors and progress. With strategic movement, every action requires planning: mechanical enemies react to your moves in real-time, lethal turbines can be tools or traps, and hidden secrets await discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459390/extras/8521775a4cab6d4461c7d26d173f3ae1.poster.avif?t=1755639786\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459390/extras/8521775a4cab6d4461c7d26d173f3ae1.webp?t=1755639786\" class=\"bb_img\" width=264 height=136 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The blend of minimalist black-and-white pixel art, immersive ambient sounds, and fragmented storytelling creates a unique atmosphere where tension rises with every step. Uncover the truth behind the invasion that left the ship silent and decide your ultimate fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459390/extras/4eba80f78d03dadf0fc2af9d9099e66e.poster.avif?t=1755639786\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459390/extras/4eba80f78d03dadf0fc2af9d9099e66e.webp?t=1755639786\" class=\"bb_img\" width=264 height=136 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist Retro Art:</strong> A striking 1-bit style that merges simplicity with expressive details, bringing the ship\u2019s eerie personality to life.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Puzzles:</strong> Use keys, buttons, and turbines to solve logic-driven challenges without frustration.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Enemies:</strong> Mechanical spiders and drones react to your movements, demanding strategic thinking.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragmented Narrative:</strong> Piece together the story through cryptic AI messages, collectible logs, and environmental storytelling.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Atmosphere:</strong> Immersive soundscapes, haunting silences, and a monochromatic visual style pull you into the mystery.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Accessible Gameplay:</strong> Easy to learn, with progressive difficulty and secrets for dedicated players.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459390/extras/74384da23e84e82f04eca2e1a5ec9dee.poster.avif?t=1755639786\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459390/extras/74384da23e84e82f04eca2e1a5ec9dee.webp?t=1755639786\" class=\"bb_img\" width=264 height=136 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Full Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Unique Levels:</strong> Explore themed sectors like Engineering, Biological Lab, and the Ship\u2019s Core, each with distinct challenges.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ Phases:</strong> Creative combinations of mechanics, enemies, and puzzles that evolve as you advance.  </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability:</strong> Achievements, leaderboards, and alternate endings based on your choices.  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What Players Say</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cAwesome puzzle game! I love the mechanics of collecting items and using switches.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cIncredible art! Equal parts creepy and captivating.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe soundtrack pulls you deep into the ship\u2019s atmosphere.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cIncredible one-bit graphics. Congrats!\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459390/extras/73f784bb238f29333e70a6a1847f0c2a.poster.avif?t=1755639786\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3459390/extras/73f784bb238f29333e70a6a1847f0c2a.webp?t=1755639786\" class=\"bb_img\" width=264 height=328 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare for the Journey</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The ship is silent. Your destiny is in your hands.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd17 <strong>Wishlist now and get notified at launch!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for those who love:</strong>\u00a0Strategic puzzles, retro aesthetics, and gripping mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
